  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/03/DivercontesIgualtat.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(12 fotos) La bilioteca infantil d&#39;Onda ha acollit la vesprada d&#39;aquest divendres un taler de diverticontes per la igualtat, en fam&iacute;lia, dins dels actes organitzats per l&#39;Ajuntament amb motiu del Mar&ccedil; de la Dona.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerbibliotecainfantil/img_1971.jpg\" alt=\"img_1971\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerbibliotecainfantil/img_1972.jpg\" alt=\"img_1972\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerbibliotecainfantil/img_1974.jpg\" alt=\"img_1974\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerbibliotecainfantil/img_1976.jpg\" alt=\"img_1976\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerbibliotecainfantil/img_1978.jpg\" alt=\"img_1978\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerbibliotecainfantil/img_1980.jpg\" alt=\"img_1980\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerbibliotecainfantil/img_1981.jpg\" alt=\"img_1981\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerbibliotecainfantil/img_1982.jpg\" alt=\"img_1982\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/tallerbibliotecainfantil/img_1983.jpg\" alt=\"img_1983\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439ef